yi-mediad
==============

`mediad` - a drop-in replacement for the stock `rmm` media daemon on Yi
(Allwinner sun8iw19p1 / V831-class) IP cameras: capture -> ISP -> hardware H.264
encode -> the `/dev/shm/fshare_frame_buf` ring + mic AAC, plus the picture-control
surface.

